# Antislop Audit Report — 001 (2026-11-09)

**Mode:** AFTER (Audit-first workflow — All 16 findings approved and fixed)
**Scope:** Full codebase (`src/pages/index.astro`, `src/components/Hero.astro`, `src/components/ScrollVideo.astro`, `src/components/Synopsis.astro`, `src/components/SpecsGrid.astro`, `src/components/CheckoutCTA.astro`, `src/pages/api/checkout.ts`, `tailwind.config.mjs`, `DESIGN.md`)
**Skills Applied:** `antislop` (core), `antislop-ui`, `antislop-human`, `antislop-layoutmobile`, `antislop-code`

---

## High Priority Findings (Hard Gate)

1. **[FIXED] [HIGH] R-02 — Forbidden em dash (`—`) in UI copy (`src/components/Synopsis.astro`, `src/pages/index.astro`)**
   Resolution: Replaced the literal `—` in `Synopsis.astro` and `&mdash;` in `index.astro` with a period and colon (`ISBN 978-967-5131-28-8. Terbitan bersama Brainwave dan Prestasi Media.` and `Siapa Akan Menguasai Putrajaya?: Karya Ronifira Rejab`). Verified zero `—` or `&mdash;` characters remain in `src/`.

2. **[FIXED] [HIGH] R-17 / R-23 / R-38 — Unverified sales counter (`142 / 200`) presented as live data (`src/components/CheckoutCTA.astro`, `src/pages/index.astro`)**
   Resolution: Removed the hardcoded `claimedQuota = 142` and replaced the counter label with `Kuota: 200 Naskhah Terawal ([DATA SEBENAR] Stok Langsung)` so no unverified sales statistic is fabricated.

3. **[FIXED] [HIGH] R-23 / R-38 — Plausible fake person data used in form placeholders (`src/components/CheckoutCTA.astro`)**
   Resolution: Replaced fictional person details (`Contoh: Ahmad bin Abdullah`, `Contoh: ahmad@emel.com`, `Contoh: 012-3456789`) with honest instructional prompts (`Nama penuh penerima`, `emel@contoh.com`, `Nombor telefon bimbit`).

4. **[FIXED] [HIGH] R-24 / R-26 — Brand link in header points to dead `#` anchor (`src/pages/index.astro`, `src/components/Hero.astro`)**
   Resolution: Added `id="utama"` to the hero section in `Hero.astro` and updated the navbar brand link in `index.astro` to `href="#utama"`.

5. **[FIXED] [HIGH] R-25 — Text and non-text contrast failures verified by `contrast-check.py` (`src/pages/index.astro`, `src/components/CheckoutCTA.astro`)**
   Resolution: Upgraded footer copyright text from `text-slate-500` (`3.97:1`) to `text-slate-400` (`7.37:1`, PASS 4.5:1), upgraded form placeholders to `placeholder-slate-400` (`7.37:1`), and upgraded all interactive control borders from `border-slate-700`/`border-slate-800` to `border-slate-500` (`3.97:1` on `#09111e` and `3.75:1` on `#0f172a`, PASS 3:1 non-text contrast).

6. **[FIXED] [HIGH] R-32 — Weak 1px focus ring after `focus:outline-none`, unstyled radio focus, and missing skip link (`src/components/CheckoutCTA.astro`, `src/pages/index.astro`)**
   Resolution: Replaced `focus:outline-none focus:ring-1` with a 2px high-contrast yellow focus outline (`focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-yellow-400`), added `focus-within:outline` to the region radio cards, and added a keyboard skip link (`Langkau ke kandungan utama` -> `#kandungan-utama`) at the top of `<body>`.

7. **[FIXED] [HIGH] R-39 — Missing base `cursor: pointer` rule, missing `:active` states, unguarded motion, and no pause control on looping videos (`src/pages/index.astro`, `src/components/ScrollVideo.astro`)**
   Resolution: Added global CSS rules assigning `cursor: pointer` to all enabled controls and `cursor: not-allowed` to disabled controls, added `:active` states (`active:translate-y-px`), guarded animations/smooth-scroll under `@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)` and `window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)')`, and added a dedicated keyboard-accessible `Jeda Video` / `Mainkan Video` button (`data-playback-toggle`) with `aria-pressed` state alongside the audio toggle button.

8. **[FIXED] [HIGH] R-40 — Hero `<img>` missing `fetchpriority="high"` and `<video>` missing intrinsic `width`/`height` (`src/components/Hero.astro`, `src/components/ScrollVideo.astro`)**
   Resolution: Added `fetchpriority="high"` to the hero `<img>` and explicit `width="478" height="850"` to `<video>` in `ScrollVideo.astro`.

9. **[FIXED] [HIGH] R-37 — Missing `DESIGN.md` / explicit Design Read declaration (`ENERGY / RHYTHM / MOTION` dials)**
   Resolution: Created `DESIGN.md` declaring the Design Read, dials (`ENERGY 2 / RHYTHM 3 / MOTION 2`), computed WCAG contrast ratios, and one-line design justifications (`R-31`).

---

## Medium Priority Findings (Purpose-Gate)

10. **[FIXED] [MEDIUM] R-01 / R-13 — Unjustified radial glow and blurred orb behind hero cover (`src/components/Hero.astro`)**
    Resolution: Removed the full-section radial gradient overlay and blurred yellow orb behind the book cover, keeping only a single purposeful elevation shadow on the physical book cover frame (`R-12`).

11. **[FIXED] [MEDIUM] R-08 — Decorative right-arrow icon inside vertical-scroll CTA button (`src/components/Hero.astro`)**
    Resolution: Removed the right-pointing arrow SVG from the "Beli Sekarang" CTA button.

12. **[FIXED] [MEDIUM] R-09 — Capsule eyebrow badges with decorative status dot above headlines (`src/components/Hero.astro`, `src/components/CheckoutCTA.astro`)**
    Resolution: Removed the capsule pill wrappers and fake status dot (`h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-yellow-400`), replacing them with clean editorial kicker text.

13. **[FIXED] [MEDIUM] R-14 — Uniform copy-paste cards in `SpecsGrid.astro` (`src/components/SpecsGrid.astro`)**
    Resolution: Rebuilt `SpecsGrid.astro` into a two-tier hierarchy: top quantitative cards (`430 Muka Surat` and `Terhad 200 Naskhah Terawal`) with prominent tabular numerals, followed by a divided two-column editorial methodology panel (`Lensa Politik Pasca-Normal` and `Analisis Data & Kajian Lapangan`) without decorative bottom bars.

---

## Low Priority Findings (Quality Locks & Comment Hygiene)

14. **[FIXED] [LOW] R-05 (`antislop-layoutmobile`) — Two-state layout jump and uniform section headers (`src/components/Hero.astro`, `src/pages/index.astro`)**
    Resolution: Added tablet (`md:grid-cols-12`) intermediate layout states, fluid `clamp()` typography, scaled mobile padding (`py-12` / `py-14`), and varied section compositions across the page (Video 2 now uses an asymmetric 2-column editorial + video split layout).

15. **[FIXED] [LOW] R-03 (`antislop-layoutmobile`) — Under-sized tap targets (< 44x44px) on mobile (`src/pages/index.astro`, `src/components/ScrollVideo.astro`, `src/components/CheckoutCTA.astro`)**
    Resolution: Enforced `min-h-[44px]` to `min-h-[52px]` across all navbar links, video playback/sound buttons, form inputs, radio cards, and CTA buttons, and removed the invalid `-bottom-0` class.

16. **[FIXED] [LOW] R-31 (`antislop-code`) — Comments restating obvious HTML/TS structure (`src/pages/index.astro`, `src/components/*.astro`, `src/pages/api/checkout.ts`, `tailwind.config.mjs`)**
    Resolution: Removed all banner and markup-restating HTML/TS comments, retaining only concise single-line comments that document non-obvious constraints (listener deduplication, CHIP Collect integer sen pricing, and server-side secret proxy).
